@startuml
!include ../../../../../../plantuml/sodexo-theme.puml

title Reassess a materially changed offer — End-to-end interaction
header Sat, 25 Jul 2026 · End-to-end discovery sequence
footer (c) Developed by <b>Mohit Kanwar</b>

hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 90

actor "Approver" as Actor
participant "Approval Workspace" as Surface
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Accommodation Experience API" as Edge
participant "Booking Workflow Service" as Service1
database "Service-owned data" as Data
queue "Kafka event platform" as Events



group 1. Return original and replacement offer versions with material differences.
  Actor -> Surface: Return original and replacement offer versions with material differences
  Surface -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/approvals/{approvalId}/changed-offer
  Gateway -> Edge: JWT, tenant scope, correlation ID
  Edge -> Service1: Return original and replacement offer versions with material differences.
  alt authorised and valid
  Service1 -> Service1: Authorise and query
  Service1 -> Data: Read or commit Booking Workflow Service data
  Service1 --> Edge: Scoped result
  Edge --> Surface: Response envelope
  Surface --> Actor: Updated journey state
else validation, state, or dependency failure
  Service1 --> Edge: Problem details + retryability
  Edge --> Surface: Safe error and next action
  Surface --> Actor: Correct, retry later, or escalate
end
end

group 2. Record approve or reject as an immutable, versioned decision.
  Actor -> Surface: Record approve or reject as an immutable, versioned decision
  Surface -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/approvals/{approvalId}/decisions
  Gateway -> Edge: JWT, tenant scope, correlation ID
  Edge -> Service1: Record approve or reject as an immutable, versioned decision.
  alt authorised and valid
  Service1 -> Service1: Validate transition and persist
  Service1 -> Data: Read or commit Booking Workflow Service data
  Service1 -> Events: Publish committed domain event
  Service1 --> Edge: Accepted state and next actions
  Edge --> Surface: Response envelope
  Surface --> Actor: Updated journey state
else validation, state, or dependency failure
  Service1 --> Edge: Problem details + retryability
  Edge --> Surface: Safe error and next action
  Surface --> Actor: Correct, retry later, or escalate
end
end

@enduml
